        "content": "<p>jrandolf opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14836\">PR #14836</a> from <code>jrandolf:map-tracing-elide</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Like lists, maps can be arbitrarily large and their contents come from the guest, so this only logs them when <code>verbose_tracing</code> is enabled. Previously a map was only elided if its key or value type contained a list, so e.g. <code>map&lt;u32, u32&gt;</code> arguments were logged in full.</p>\n<p>This is based on #14834 so the change shows up in the <code>map_tracing_async</code> snapshot; only the last commit is new.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
